<tr>
<th id="nami2">ナミテントウ(2紋型)</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki017.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki017.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki018.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki018.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki020.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki020.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki019.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki019.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：菅谷　中<br />
<br />
シベリア、中国、朝鮮半島、日本に生息するテントウムシ。2紋は九州方面に多いそうです。<br />
<br />
光沢感のある塗装や、細かく造形された脚がとてもリアルです。<br />
	</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th id="nami19">ナミテントウ(19紋型)</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki008.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki008.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki009.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki009.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki010.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki010.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：菅谷　中<br />
<br />
テントウムシと言えば、なカラー。19紋は北海道・東北・日光地方に多いそうです。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th id="kumo">アダンソンハエトリグモ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki002.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki002.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki003.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki003.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki004.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki004.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：田熊勝夫<br />
<br />
日本では家屋に普通に見られ、世界中に分布する。大きさは5～7mmほど。<br />
<br />
頭部の塗装はみごと。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th id="kaiko">カイコガ(雄)</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki015.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki016.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki001.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：山本聖士<br />
<br />
家畜化された動物で野生には存在せず、野生に戻ることも出来ない唯一の家畜化動物。白い見た目は敵に見つけられやすく、成虫になっても飛ぶことは出来ず、口がないためエサも食べられない。交尾のみ行い数日中に死ぬ。<br />
<br />
もう一回り大きいサイズで欲しかった。特徴的な触角が角みたいに見えてしまいます。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th id="hae">イエバエ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/hittuki012.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/hittuki012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki012.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hittuki013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hittuki013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/hittuki/img/hittuki013.jpg" --></a></td>
